  Materialized East_Asian_Width range tables (UCD 17.0.0), extracted from
  `EastAsianWidth.txt` and pinned as `List` literals so per-codepoint
  lookups reduce in the kernel. The parser and the `include_str` source
  live in `Unicode.Generated.EastAsianWidth`, which imports this module
  and carries the build-time drift gate proving the literals match the
  parse.
-/

namespace Unicode.Generated.EastAsianWidth

set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

